      "name": "list_git_changes",
      "legacy_package": "git",
      "description": "List changed file metadata without reading source bodies. Omit target and cursor for all working changes; select an explicit worktree, commit or range target otherwise. Exactly one target or cursor is accepted. Continue using next verbatim; use cursor {snapshot,after_path:null} to repeat from the same frozen target. Commits and ranges resolve once to full SHAs. Each page has at most 500 entries and 48 KiB encoded JSON. Only exhausted=true and omitted_paths=0 proves complete inventory. No patches, statistics or rename similarity are computed. Select only registered worktrees in this session project.",
